<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Dec oil product stockpiles - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Dec oil product stockpiles - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Tuesday</p>
<p>issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-December:</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p>Gasoline	1,906	 11,989    - 2.2    - 5.5</p>
<p>Naphtha	 1,665	 10,473    - 0.2    + 7.8</p>
<p>Jet Fuel	  669	  4,208    -15.5    - 8.1</p>
<p>Kerosene	4,116	 25,890    -15.5    +33.2</p>
<p>Gas Oil	 2,335	 14,687    + 1.5    +43.9</p>
<p>Fuel Oil A    1,728	 10,869    - 2.6    +19.2</p>
<p>Fuel Oil B	  5	     31    +25.5    +25.5</p>
<p>Fuel Oil C    1,967	 12,372    - 1.3    + 3.0</p>
<p>Total	  14,391	 90,519    - 6.3    +16.4</p>
</text>
